// The server is headless and runs no Obsidian, so it has no use for a vault
// config directory. Excluding all of .obsidian/ also keeps Syncthing from
// fighting Obsidian Sync, which owns settings/plugins/themes between the
// Obsidian clients (laptop, phone). Two sync systems managing one config
// directory produce endless conflict files.
.obsidian

// Syncthing's own delete archive. Never sync the archive itself.
.stversions

// Obsidian's per-vault trash.
.trash
